flowchart TB
    Tracker["Thiết bị theo dõi trên xe<br/>ESP32-S3 + SIM7600 + OBD2"]
    EMQX["EMQX (broker MQTT)"]
    Bridge["MQTT Bridge"]
    API["API phía máy chủ + Socket.IO"]
    Store["PostgreSQL + VictoriaMetrics + VictoriaLogs"]
    WebClients["Giao diện web / di động"]
    Grafana["Grafana"]

    Tracker -->|Rawdata / status / events / firmware| EMQX
    EMQX -->|Device topics -> bridge| Bridge
    Bridge --> Store
    Bridge -->|Publish internal/events/#| EMQX
    EMQX -->|Backend realtime listener| API
    WebClients -->|REST requests| API
    API -->|REST responses + Socket.IO| WebClients
    API -->|Commands / OTA| EMQX
    EMQX -->|Topic commands| Tracker
    Store --> Grafana
